text.paragraph:
Regularly evaluate patients, particularly when initiating and titrating HYSINGLA ER and when HYSINGLA ER is given concomitantly with other drugs that depress respiration [see Warnings and Precautions (5.2, 5.3), 
                            Drug Interactions (7)
                           ].  Alternatively, consider the use of non-opioid analgesics in these patients.
